#: ../../source/recipes/minimax_m3.rst:83
msgid ""
"**Sparse attention with a lightning indexer.** M3 runs grouped-query full"
" attention plus a DeepSeek-style sparse-attention indexer. Each sparse "
"layer owns two paged caches — the main K/V (rank-5) and a key-only "
"indexer cache (rank-3) — which vLLM places in a single "
"``UniformTypeKVCacheSpecs`` engine group. LMCache detects both layouts "
"and stores/retrieves each as its own group; the indexer keys travel with "
"the K/V because they cannot be recomputed from the cached K/V on a hit."
msgstr "**使用稀疏注意力和闪电索引器。** M3 运行分组查询全注意力加上 DeepSeek 风格的稀疏注意力索引器。每个稀疏层拥有两个分页缓存——主要的 K/V（rank-5）和仅键索引器缓存（rank-3）——vLLM 将它们放置在一个 ``UniformTypeKVCacheSpecs`` 引擎组中。LMCache 检测到这两种布局，并将每种布局作为自己的组进行存储/检索；索引器键与 K/V 一起传输，因为在缓存命中时无法从缓存的 K/V 重计算。"

#: ../../source/recipes/minimax_m3.rst:90
msgid ""
"**``--block-size 128`` is required.** M3's indexer uses "
"``sparse_block_size = 128``; vLLM cannot reconcile the default block size"
" (16) or 64 across the full-attention and sparse kernels and aborts KV-"
"cache init with ``No common block size``. Use 128."
msgstr "**``--block-size 128`` 是必需的。** M3 的索引器使用 ``sparse_block_size = 128``；vLLM 无法在全注意力和稀疏内核之间协调默认块大小（16）或 64，并在 ``No common block size`` 错误中终止 KV Cache 初始化。请使用 128。"

#: ../../source/recipes/minimax_m3.rst:94
msgid ""
"**LMCache chunk size must be a multiple of the block size.** The default "
"chunk size (256) already satisfies 128, so no extra flag is needed; if "
"you pass ``--chunk-size`` to the server, keep it a multiple of 128."
msgstr "**LMCache 块大小必须是块大小的倍数。** 默认块大小（256）已经满足128，因此不需要额外的标志；如果你传递 ``--chunk-size`` 给服务器，请保持其为128的倍数。"

